1
00:00:00,789 --> 00:00:02,209
(Howard:)- Leonard?
- Yeah, buddy?

2
00:00:02,374 --> 00:00:04,084
(Sheldon:)I still don't like this cushion.

3
00:00:08,964 --> 00:00:10,384
(Leonard:)Okay, first of all...

4
00:00:10,549 --> 00:00:13,719
(Leonard:)- ...Penny, thank you for coming.
- Oh, thanks for the shoes.

5
00:00:14,136 --> 00:00:17,426
(Leonard:)Penny is an amazing shot. I think
we have a chance to win this week.

6
00:00:17,598 --> 00:00:20,018
- What's the plan?
- Okay. Now, we all run out...

7
00:00:20,184 --> 00:00:22,934
(Leonard:)...Sheldon and I will cut to the left
behind these trees.

8
00:00:23,103 --> 00:00:26,063
(Leonard:)Raj, Howard and Leslie
flank to the right behind the rocks.

9
00:00:26,231 --> 00:00:29,731
(Leonard:)We'll all have a great view as Penny
runs out and kills everyone in sight.

10
00:00:29,902 --> 00:00:32,742
All right, just one thing before we start.

11
00:00:32,905 --> 00:00:34,485
(Leonard:)What is it, Sheldon?

12
00:00:34,656 --> 00:00:35,656
Oh!

13
00:00:37,451 --> 00:00:38,661
(Penny:)What the hell?

14
00:00:39,161 --> 00:00:41,791
(Sheldon:)That was for my cushion.

15
00:00:41,955 --> 00:00:44,375
(Leonard:)Sheldon, Penny was our only hope.

16
00:00:44,541 --> 00:00:49,631
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, Leonard.
But revenge is a dish best served cold.

17
00:00:50,756 --> 00:00:52,716
(Penny:)Screw that.

18
00:00:55,177 --> 00:00:56,807
(Sheldon:)She can't shoot me. She's dead.

19
00:00:57,596 --> 00:00:59,726
(Leonard:)He's right. You can't.

20
00:01:05,229 --> 00:01:09,069
(Sheldon:)Well, if we're going to descend
into anarchy...

21
00:01:13,445 --> 00:01:15,445
(Howard:)Okay. See you.

22
00:01:16,990 --> 00:01:18,160
(Leonard:)Where are you going?

23
00:01:18,325 --> 00:01:20,785
(Leslie:)Surrender, then Denny's.

